==German==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈpfaɪ̯fən/|[ˈpfaɪ̯fən]|[pfaɪ̯fɱ̩]|lang=de}} {{a|standard}}
* {{IPA|/ˈfaɪ̯fən/|lang=de}} {{a|most speakers in northern and central Germany}}
* {{audio|De-pfeifen.ogg|Audio}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb-strong|class=1|pfeift|pfiff|gepfiffen|past subjunctive=pfiffe}}

# {{context|intransitive|or|transitive|lang=de}} to [[whistle]] (with one's mouth or a whistle)
#: ''Hör auf zu '''pfeifen'''!'' – Stop whistling!
#: ''Er '''pfeift''' ein Liedchen.'' – He's whistling a song.
# {{context|intransitive|sports|lang=de}} to act as [[referee]]
#: ''Wer '''pfeift''' das Spiel?'' – Who's refereeing the game?
# {{context|colloquial|intransitive|_|with preposition [[auf]]|lang=de}} to be [[uninterested]] (in something or someone); to [[ignore]]; not to [[give a damn]]
#: ''Darauf '''pfeif''' ich!'' – I don't care one bit about that!

